<title>BELGIUM: Brussels bourse to modify S.Africa gold mine index.</title>
<headline>Brussels bourse to modify S.Africa gold mine index.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brussels Stock Exchange said on Thursday it would increase the number of South African gold mines in its B-Gold Index to take account of recent listings.</p>
<p>The mines entering the index, which will also be reweighted, will be Avgold, Beatrix Mines and Harmony Gold Mining Ltd.</p>
<p>The changes take effect on March 24. The new and old weights (number of shares) are:</p>
<p>    Issue	  New weight   Old weight</p>
<p>    Driefontein   735	    930</p>
<p>    Southvaal	95	    120</p>
<p>    Western Deep  100	    125</p>
<p>    Freegold	430	    545</p>
<p>    Vaal Reefs     70	     85</p>
<p>    Avgold	1,250	    nil</p>
<p>    Beatrix Mines 350	    nil</p>
<p>    Harmony	 140	    nil</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
